{"repositoryId":1304883313,"availability":"available","full":"marcoscivera08/tfg-incendios-valencia","name":"tfg-incendios-valencia","description":"Modelos de Machine Learning para la predicción de susceptibilidad de incendios forestales en la Comunitat Valenciana. Trabajo Fin de Grado en Ciencia de Datos.","category":"Education","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-18T12:19:40Z","updated":"2026-10-13T10:26:16Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://incendios-valencia.streamlit.app/","topics":["data-science","data-visualization","geospatial","lightgbm","machine-learning","shap","streamlit","wildfire"],"demo":"https://incendios-valencia.streamlit.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.798Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.798Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.798Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.798Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Pipeline de datos multifuente + LightGBM + explicabilidad SHAP + dashboard en Streamlit. Trabajo Fin de Grado en Ciencia de Datos · Universitat de València (ETSE) · Calificación: 8,8","In English: End-to-end ML system that estimates daily wildfire ignition susceptibility across the Valencian Community (Spain). It merges 4,476 official fire records (2010–2022) with ERA5 weather reanalysis, SRTM topography and 1:10,000 land-cover maps, trains LightGBM classifiers under two pseudo-absence sampling designs, tunes the decision threshold for civil-protection priorities (F2-score), explains every prediction with SHAP and serves it all in an interactive Streamlit dashboard. ROC-AUC 0.94 · Recall 89 % at the operational threshold."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/marcoscivera08/tfg-incendios-valencia/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b4dc3eee73a8b7336a23836da7bd3c284336510371313363d69d283a9d7e6b4c","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.897Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:47:50.897